$CATEGORY: Printing/Choosing a printer

::Default printer::Which printer does a program use when you press Ctrl+P? {
=The default printer #Right: the default printer is used unless you choose another.
~The last printer you used #Not unless you set it that way.
~The nearest printer
~A printer chosen at random
}

::Paper sizes::Which of these are paper sizes? {
~%50%Letter
~%50%A4
~%-100%Ledger blue
}

::Print preview::Print preview shows the pages before they are printed. {TRUE}

$CATEGORY: Printing/Settings

::Copies box::The box for how many copies to print is called the {=Copies =copies count} box.

::Shortcut::Which key, held with P, opens the Print window? {=Ctrl =Control}

::Match the setting::Match each setting with what it does. {
=Copies -> How many of each page
=Orientation -> Which way the page turns
=Scale -> How large the page prints
}

::Pages per sheet::How many pages fit on one sheet when you choose 2 per sheet? {#2}

::Margins::How many millimetres is a normal margin on A4 paper? {#25:5}

